Unified multi-brand design tokens, accessible React UI kit, documentation hub, and automated synchronization pipeline between Figma and codebases.

## Tokens as Infrastructure

Four product brands, one system. Semantic tokens (surface, accent, alert) map to per-brand primitive palettes, so a theme swap is a build-time transform — not a redesign. The same token JSON drives Figma variables, the React UI kit, and documentation examples, eliminating drift by construction.

## Adoption

- Accessible React UI kit with WCAG 2.1 AA baked into every component
- Documentation hub with live, theme-switchable examples
- CI pipeline that fails the build on token or contrast regressions

The system reached 15k+ community downloads with zero visual regressions reported across brand migrations.
